// NERVA_ALLHOODS_DUOGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1378915916" "I have my orders and you're not getting through!"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P602317393" "Right.  There's activity everywhere.  Where should we start?  Over."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1083839119" "Keep the line clear.  Over."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3330422323" "Crimson Cove just got a lot more dangerous."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2298039218" "We're on it.  We'll keep our eyes open."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3146868640" "I'll pick my battles.  Don't worry about it."

// NERVA_CRIMSON_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2234834543" "I see someone!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1933803763" "I see something!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3162431997" "Villain alert!  Let's go!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1306571735" "Finally!  Some action!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3364094957" "I spotted someone!"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1986274916" "We'll get this section and switch with Longbow for the south end later."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3206312441" "Right.  Two more hours of patrol then we switch to guard duty."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4155518017" "Okay, let's keep going.  These streets are never boring."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2946382602" "Between us and Longbow, we'll catch a lot of punks."

// NERVA_CRIMSON_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2027986972" "Time to fight!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P653503828" "Our patrol just got a bit more interesting."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2756209970" "I see some fun up ahead."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
